# 🚗 Stolen Connected Vehicle – SOC Investigation

> **Freelance Junior SOC Analyst | Remote Investigation | 07/2026–10/2026**

## Overview

Investigation of a reported stolen connected vehicle from a SOC and DFIR perspective.

The investigation focused on correlating **mobile application/API logs, cloud events, vehicle telemetry and CAN data** to reconstruct the incident timeline and evaluate potential attack scenarios.

